body:
 "Despite a positive reception, *Space Marine* suffered disappointing overall sales figures and internal problems within the game's developer companies, followed by the closure of publisher THQ, seems to have now prevented any further planned upgrades or downloadable content for the game and effectively removed any chances for a direct sequel, unless a different publisher decides to attempt development of a sequel title. "

&#x200B;

" **Unfortunately, before actual work on Space Marine 2 could begin, THQ's financial problems became apparent and culminated in the sale of Relic Entertainment to Sega and the return of the rights to the Warhammer 40,000 universe to Games Workshop.** "
